# Changelog

## 0.1.2-beta - 2026-10-07

### Fixed
* In **Materials** check **Color Space Valid**:
  * Trace through Color Ramp/Math/Mix nodes instead of classifying by socket name.
  * Subsurface Radius is now Non-Color.
  * Use Blender's is_data flag; remove Required Colorspace setting (will now work no matter what OCIO is loaded).
  * Flag color textures (Base Color etc.) set to Non-Color; Fix sets them to sRGB.

